ositions and goal types.\r\n- More of the app follows your language: the Home highlight, the version picker, language badges, and episode and catch-up dates.\r\n- The XR 3D version menu is now in your language too.\r\n- Browse by Genre cards have fresh new icons.\r\n- TV Guide refreshes on its own after your playlist updates, keeps your guide if the provider sends an empty one, and shows a clear message with Retry if a download fails.\r\n- Fixed: the source card could wrongly say the guide update failed.\r\n- Today in sports on Home now opens at the first match instead of jumping to the end.\r\n- Leagues without highlights no longer show an empty highlights row.\r\n- Event channels can now be found by team nicknames and short codes.\r\n- Images load more smoothly and use less memory.\r\n- If your device language isn't supported, the app now uses English.", "created_date": 1792359328, "id": "28549643604700878", "version": "3.3.7", "version_code": 4172, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28549643604700878"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Watch in XR 3D now works for live TV, one tap from the channel lists.\r\n- A roomier layout: more rows and cards fit on the panel.\r\n- The XR bar shows the stream quality.\r\n- New: create your own Favorites lists, synced across your devices.\r\n- Favorite a channel with one tap from Live TV and Sports.\r\n- Movie posters now show how far you've watched, synced across your devices.\r\n- Preview a live channel at the top of Live TV and Search before opening the full player.\r\n- Redesigned Live TV channel cards: clean logos with Preview, favorite and Start Over buttons below.\r\n- \"On Now\" shows what is playing on each channel in Live TV, the player and Continue Watching.\r\n- Sports game cards now show the date and time.\r\n- Remove entries from Recent in the category picker.\r\n- Choose a Version no longer marks versions as Not available by mistake.\r\n- Channel logos look cleaner, with white logos on a dark background.\r\n- Fixes and stability improvements.", "created_date": 1791601035, "id": "28427288650269708", "version": "3.3.6", "version_code": 4169, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28549643604700878"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "-Videos now keep playing when you use another app or panel next to o3IPTV, so you can watch while you play or browse.", "created_date": 1791056295, "id": "28342832718715302", "version": "3.3.5", "version_code": 4156, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28549643604700878"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Watch in XR 3D now plays 180 and 360 degree VR videos, in 3D or mono, detected from the title or set with Projection in the player.\r\n- VR 180 and VR 360 titles show a VR chip on their details page and open in XR on every Quest, picking the VR version when a movie has several.\r\n- In 180 and 360 videos, the controls appear where you look and the display follows the film's frame rate.\r\n- Your 180 or 360 pick is remembered for each title.\r\n- Switch movie versions without leaving XR 3D, and Continue Watching keeps one row for the movie.\r\n- The headset battery shows on the XR control bar, with low battery notices at 15% and 5%.\r\n- Controller ray: menus and buttons light up when you point at them.\r\n- Lists in every sheet now scroll with the controller ray, and the player and language pickers show a scrollbar.\r\n- Single-connection playlists no longer get cut off by background checks.\r\n- When all connections are in use, the message now suggests another playlist if you have one.\r\n- Sports match pages open with their channels in place.", "created_date": 1790924318, "id": "28323084267356814", "version": "3.3.5", "version_code": 4155, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28549643604700878"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Fixed a crash when closing the app while a video was playing.\r\n- Browse by Genre on Home: new, popular and top rated titles from your playlist, with grid, list and sorting.\r\n- New Favorites row on Home: your channels, movies, series and teams.\r\n- Exclude new categories automatically, per playlist, synced across your devices.\r\n- Fixed endless loading on some providers that then said all connections were in use.\r\n- New-category notices now show only on the main profile.", "created_date": 1790447418, "id": "28257836330548275", "version": "3.3.4", "version_code": 4136, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}